# L §5.16: "An invalid parameter is refused at that key (RUN-PARAM), never NaN": normal with s = 0 (s > 0).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input bad: dist

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  bad = normal(0, 0) to 1e-9

ask a: mean(bad) law 2026-06-30
=== expect
a: refused: RUN-PARAM ...
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-12-31
